{
  "note": [
    "Project Corridor East's fabric, cut from the one Lawanda layout in scripts/fabric-lawanda.mjs -- regenerate from there, do not hand-edit. PROJECT-CORRIDOR-EAST v2: 12 x 3.6 x 8, the eye at the middle, the east end of the project hallway. No objects: four doorless mouths and bare worn concrete.",
    "North, 1.8 x 2.6 onto the Library Lobby and THE DEEP LINE READ BACKWARDS: the Lobby's dusty carpet, its north mouth 14.16 m out, Systems Corridor East, its north mouth 24.32 m out with the lettered Planateree Kors Kontrool panel above it, and a slice of Course Control's far north bank about 1.46 m each side of the axis 39.48 m from the eye (PROJECT-CORRIDOR-EAST v2, LIBRARY-LOBBY-MOUTH). No door leaf anywhere in the chain.",
    "South, 1.8 x 2.6 at x -3.5 onto the COMPUTER ROOM, seen diagonally south-west: its floor and its plain WEST wall between its z -2.6 and +2.15, 11.0 to 14.7 m out, floor to ceiling. Its west mouth to the Projcon Office stays 0.3 m out of view, and so do its red light, the booth mouth and the NE branch (COMPUTER-ROOM-MOUTH). The south wall either side of this mouth is blank: the Library Lobby's and Course Control's accepted views end on it within 2.37 m of the axis, and this mouth's east edge is at x -2.6.",
    "West, 2.2 x 2.6 onto Project Corridor and the hallway's axis: Project Corridor's west mouth 20.16 m out and Project Corridor West beyond it, to its west wall 32.32 m from the eye. The two mouths hold the cone to about 3.0 m each side there, so SanFac F's mouth (1.8 m south of the axis) and the first metre of the Fork mouth's chamfer can show at its edges; the Projcon Office's mouth is off the axis and does not. East, 2.2 x 2.6 onto the MAIN LAB: a band of its floor and its bare east wall 22.16 m out, about 4.1 m each side (MAIN-LAB-MOUTH) -- an EMPTY placeholder, its package under review; the band reaches the ends of its NE and SE chamfers, whose heavy lock doors are drawn shut. Paint depth and light there, no equipment."
  ],
